  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "C API to import-export Python integers",
      "source_hash": 8234135154211620124,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "Python 정수를 가져오고 내보내기 위한 C API",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883116Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 17484766481657677126,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883119Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Add a new C API to import and export Python integers, :class:`int` objects: especially :c:func:`PyLongWriter_Create()` and :c:func:`PyLong_Export()` functions.",
      "source_hash": 12754283179643018179,
      "context_hash": 10356062162691928027,
      "translation": "Python 정수인 :class:`int` 객체를 가져오고 내보내기 위한 새로운 C API를 추가합니다. 특히 :c:func:`PyLongWriter_Create()` 및 :c:func:`PyLong_Export()` 함수를 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883120Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rationale",
      "source_hash": 18339363210720796208,
      "context_hash": 13898592345178467626,
      "translation": "근거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883120Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Projects such as `gmpy2 <https://github.com/aleaxit/gmpy>`_, `SAGE <https://www.sagemath.org/>`_ and `Python-FLINT <https://github.com/flintlib/python-flint>`_ access directly Python \"internals\" (the :c:type:`PyLongObject` structure) or use an inefficient temporary format (hex strings for Python-FLINT) to import and export Python :class:`int` objects.",
      "source_hash": 17899584652756957364,
      "context_hash": 9323839463923665897,
      "translation": "`gmpy2 <https://github.com/aleaxit/gmpy>`_, `SAGE <https://www.sagemath.org/>`_ 및 `Python-FLINT <https://github.com/flintlib/python-flint>`_\\ 와 같은 프로젝트는 Python :class:`int` 객체를 가져오고 내보내기 위해 Python \"내부\"( :c:type:`PyLongObject` 구조)에 직접 접근하거나 비효율적인 임시 형식(Python-FLINT의 경우 16진수 문자열)을 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883120Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The Python :class:`int` implementation changed in Python 3.12 to add a tag and \"compact values\".",
      "source_hash": 1942459166547065305,
      "context_hash": 17096164944462300529,
      "translation": "Python :class:`int` 구현은 Python 3.12에서 태그와 \"컴팩트 값\"을 추가하도록 변경되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883120Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "In the 3.13 alpha 1 release, the private undocumented :c:func:`!_PyLong_New()` function had been removed, but it is being used by these projects to import Python integers.",
      "source_hash": 14222635243614026386,
      "context_hash": 16876721159765837546,
      "translation": "3.13 alpha 1 릴리스에서는 비공개이며 문서화되지 않은 :c:func:`!_PyLong_New()` 함수가 제거되었지만, 이러한 프로젝트에서는 Python 정수를 가져오기 위해 이 함수를 사용하고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The private function has been restored in 3.13 alpha 2.",
      "source_hash": 477453449026818351,
      "context_hash": 11976971268680215961,
      "translation": "이 비공개 함수는 3.13 alpha 2에서 복원되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "A public efficient abstraction is needed to interface Python with these projects without exposing implementation details.",
      "source_hash": 10653561081446988456,
      "context_hash": 4373305499876326350,
      "translation": "구현 세부 사항을 노출하지 않고 Python과 이러한 프로젝트를 연동하려면 공개적이고 효율적인 추상화가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "It would allow Python to change its internals without breaking these projects.",
      "source_hash": 13039064994414426880,
      "context_hash": 8969626073389919476,
      "translation": "이를 통해 이러한 프로젝트를 중단하지 않고 Python의 내부 구현을 변경할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883121Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "For example, implementation for gmpy2 was changed recently for CPython 3.9 and for CPython 3.12.",
      "source_hash": 3029584505782692224,
      "context_hash": 12810231799451888779,
      "translation": "예를 들어 gmpy2의 구현은 최근 CPython 3.9 및 CPython 3.12에 맞게 변경되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883122Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Specification",
      "source_hash": 12978730460824815227,
      "context_hash": 13632936489377855985,
      "translation": "사양",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883122Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Layout API",
      "source_hash": 9695281828356682639,
      "context_hash": 15922387159730032279,
      "translation": "레이아웃 API",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883122Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Data needed by `GMP <https://gmplib.org/>`_-like `import <https://gmplib.org/manual/Integer-Import-and-Export#index-mpz_005fimport>`_-`export <https://gmplib.org/manual/Integer-Import-and-Export#index-mpz_005fexport>`_ functions.",
      "source_hash": 14987073714254397462,
      "context_hash": 500371250650209614,
      "translation": "`GMP <https://gmplib.org/>`_\\ 와 같은 `import <https://gmplib.org/manual/Integer-Import-and-Export#index-mpz_005fimport>`_–`export <https://gmplib.org/manual/Integer-Import-and-Export#index-mpz_005fexport>`_ 함수에 필요한 데이터입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883122Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Export API",
      "source_hash": 16042171204303656626,
      "context_hash": 7927716032598726018,
      "translation": "내보내기 API",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883123Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "If :c:member:`PyLongExport.digits` is not ``NULL``, a private field of the :c:struct:`PyLongExport` structure stores a strong reference to the Python :class:`int` object to make sure that that structure remains valid until :c:func:`PyLong_FreeExport()` is called.",
      "source_hash": 14224410952319668458,
      "context_hash": 4045473258018074856,
      "translation": "해당 멤버 :c:member:`PyLongExport.digits`\\ 가 ``NULL``\\ 이 아닌 경우, :c:struct:`PyLongExport` 구조체의 비공개 필드가 Python :class:`int`\\ 객체에 대한 강한 참조를 저장하여 :c:func:`PyLong_FreeExport()`\\ 가 호출될 때까지 해당 구조체가 유효하게 유지되도록 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:58:19.126484Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "On CPython 3.14, no memory copy is needed in :c:func:`PyLong_Export`, it's just a thin wrapper to expose Python :class:`int` internal digits array.",
      "source_hash": 3020830107143729245,
      "context_hash": 12138156908657000362,
      "translation": "CPython 3.14에서는 :c:func:`PyLong_Export`\\ 에서 메모리 복사가 필요하지 않으며, Python :class:`int`\\ 의 내부 digits 배열을 노출하는 얇은 래퍼일 뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883123Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Import API",
      "source_hash": 1769249796480572306,
      "context_hash": 17899288131525154548,
      "translation": "가져오기 API",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883123Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The :c:type:`PyLongWriter` API can be used to import an integer.",
      "source_hash": 7344339641717550468,
      "context_hash": 14886313695700567869,
      "translation": "정수를 가져오는 데 :c:type:`PyLongWriter` API를 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883123Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "On CPython 3.14, the :c:func:`PyLongWriter_Create` implementation is a thin wrapper to the private :c:func:`!_PyLong_New()` function.",
      "source_hash": 3498773754382863727,
      "context_hash": 14859012326248740693,
      "translation": "CPython 3.14에서 :c:func:`PyLongWriter_Create` 구현은 비공개 :c:func:`!_PyLong_New()` 함수에 대한 얇은 래퍼입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883124Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Optimize import for small integers",
      "source_hash": 16179468358353430419,
      "context_hash": 7191262733374206390,
      "translation": "작은 정수 가져오기 최적화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883124Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Proposed import API is efficient for large integers.",
      "source_hash": 5623414998879264574,
      "context_hash": 18064036468838226426,
      "translation": "제안된 가져오기 API는 큰 정수에 효율적입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883124Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Compared to accessing directly Python internals, the proposed import API can have a significant performance overhead on small integers.",
      "source_hash": 4436841902898523229,
      "context_hash": 12792943014391916536,
      "translation": "Python 내부에 직접 접근하는 것과 비교하면, 제안된 가져오기 API는 작은 정수에서 상당한 성능 오버헤드를 일으킬 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883124Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "For small integers of a few digits (for example, 1 or 2 digits), existing APIs can be used:",
      "source_hash": 18028307575703496174,
      "context_hash": 1135980095538078952,
      "translation": "몇 자리뿐인 작은 정수(예: 1자리 또는 2자리)에는 기존 API를 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:01.883125Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": ":external+py3.14:c:func:`PyLong_FromUInt64()`;",
      "source_hash": 1412292014691071615,
