    {
      "id": "section:12/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Backwards Compatibility",
      "source_hash": 10657204087101124989,
      "context_hash": 1142041077753451205,
      "translation": "하위 호환성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:12/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "There is no impact on the backward compatibility, only new APIs are added.",
      "source_hash": 9770235532879289832,
      "context_hash": 2685966588954910066,
      "translation": "하위 호환성에는 영향이 없으며, 새로운 API만 추가됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "backward compatibility": "하위 호환성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:13/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rejected Ideas",
      "source_hash": 11022998590859878680,
      "context_hash": 5905621063031036353,
      "translation": "거부된 아이디어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Support arbitrary layout",
      "source_hash": 14446006302880086457,
      "context_hash": 7669474187036865534,
      "translation": "임의 레이아웃 지원",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "It would be convenient to support arbitrary layout to import-export Python integers.",
      "source_hash": 1973785912130298455,
      "context_hash": 9330202718596060832,
      "translation": "Python 정수를 가져오고 내보낼 때 임의의 레이아웃을 지원하면 편리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "For example, it was proposed to add a *layout* parameter to :c:func:`PyLongWriter_Create()` and a *layout* member to the :c:struct:`PyLongExport` structure.",
      "source_hash": 15339198532111688913,
      "context_hash": 5857586140660192584,
      "translation": "예를 들어, :c:func:`PyLongWriter_Create()`\\ 에 *layout* 매개변수를 추가하고 :c:struct:`PyLongExport` 구조체에 *layout* 멤버를 추가하자는 제안이 있었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem is that it's more complex to implement and not really needed.",
      "source_hash": 16175117612773077929,
      "context_hash": 6193099868408517147,
      "translation": "문제는 구현이 더 복잡하고 실제로 필요하지 않다는 점입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "What's strictly needed is only an API to import-export using the Python \"native\" layout.",
      "source_hash": 10766868524901270516,
      "context_hash": 5781297089379836176,
      "translation": "엄밀히 필요한 것은 Python의 \"native\" 레이아웃을 사용하여 가져오고 내보내는 API뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:14/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "If later there are use cases for arbitrary layouts, new APIs can be added.",
      "source_hash": 12351165323247362262,
      "context_hash": 14936149236157867934,
      "translation": "나중에 임의 레이아웃에 대한 사용 사례가 생기면 새로운 API를 추가할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Don't add :c:func:`PyLong_GetNativeLayout` function",
      "source_hash": 5129060368349870327,
      "context_hash": 1901478168314039097,
      "translation": "관련 :c:func:`PyLong_GetNativeLayout` 함수를 추가하지 마십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T20:09:19.848868Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Currently, most required information for :class:`int` import/export is already available via :c:func:`PyLong_GetInfo()` (and :data:`sys.int_info`).",
      "source_hash": 11711806682418767271,
      "context_hash": 7728227640466134365,
      "translation": "현재 :class:`int` 가져오기/내보내기에 필요한 정보 대부분은 이미 :c:func:`PyLong_GetInfo()`\\ 를 통해(그리고 :data:`sys.int_info`\\ 를 통해) 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "We also can add more (like order of digits), this interface doesn't poses any constraints on future evolution of the :c:type:`PyLongObject`.",
      "source_hash": 11607253122973490615,
      "context_hash": 5449183713373185358,
      "translation": "더 많은 정보(예: 숫자의 순서)도 추가할 수 있으며, 이 인터페이스는 :c:type:`PyLongObject`\\ 의 향후 발전에 어떠한 제약도 가하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:15/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem is that the :c:func:`PyLong_GetInfo()` returns a Python object, :term:`named tuple`, not a convenient C structure and that might distract people from using it in favor e.g. of current semi-private macros like :c:macro:`!PyLong_SHIFT` and :c:macro:`!PyLong_BASE`.",
      "source_hash": 10141930656962380996,
      "context_hash": 2675208143067151299,
      "translation": "문제는 :c:func:`PyLong_GetInfo()`\\ 가 편리한 C 구조체가 아닌 Python 객체인 :term:`named tuple`\\ 을 반환한다는 점이며, 이로 인해 사람들이 현재의 반(半)비공개 매크로인 :c:macro:`!PyLong_SHIFT` 및 :c:macro:`!PyLong_BASE` 대신 이를 사용하지 않게 될 수 있다는 점입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Provide mpz_import/export-like API instead",
      "source_hash": 9001558193578677514,
      "context_hash": 2601043880923170714,
      "translation": "대신 mpz_import/export와 유사한 API 제공",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The other approach to import/export data from :class:`int` objects might be following: expect, that C extensions provide contiguous buffers that CPython then exports (or imports) the *absolute* value of an integer.",
      "source_hash": 12438833827934184431,
      "context_hash": 14384256667926983493,
      "translation": "관련 :class:`int` 객체에서 데이터를 가져오거나 내보내는 또 다른 접근 방식은 다음과 같을 수 있습니다: C 확장이 연속 버퍼를 제공하고, CPython이 그 버퍼로 정수의 *절댓값*\\ 을 내보내거나 가져온다고 가정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T20:09:19.848871Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "API example",
      "source_hash": 12138374731283519966,
      "context_hash": 1768348595097403818,
      "translation": "API 예",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "This might work for the GMP, as it has :c:func:`!mpz_limbs_read()` and :c:func:`!mpz_limbs_write()` functions, that can provide required access to internals of :c:struct:`!mpz_t`.",
      "source_hash": 5119434204715332195,
      "context_hash": 13729247871247200863,
      "translation": "GMP에는 :c:func:`!mpz_limbs_read()` 및 :c:func:`!mpz_limbs_write()` 함수가 있어 :c:struct:`!mpz_t`\\ 의 내부에 필요한 접근을 제공할 수 있으므로 이 방식이 GMP에서 작동할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Other libraries may require using temporary buffers and then mpz_import/export-like functions on their side.",
      "source_hash": 11552606008287004167,
      "context_hash": 3498817892288644032,
      "translation": "다른 라이브러리에서는 임시 버퍼를 사용한 다음 해당 라이브러리 측에서 mpz_import/export와 유사한 함수를 사용해야 할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "The major drawback of this approach is that it's much more complex on the CPython side (i.e. actual conversion between different layouts).",
      "source_hash": 8840885379179603742,
      "context_hash": 9678468869522591892,
      "translation": "이 접근 방식의 주요 단점은 CPython 측에서 훨씬 더 복잡하다는 점입니다(즉, 서로 다른 레이아웃 간의 실제 변환이 필요합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:16/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "For example, implementation of the :c:func:`PyLong_FromNativeBytes()` and the :c:func:`PyLong_AsNativeBytes()` (together provided restricted version of the required API) in the CPython took ~500 LOC (c.f. ~100 LOC in the current implementation).",
      "source_hash": 1365810934022705145,
      "context_hash": 7762948445473122307,
      "translation": "예를 들어, CPython에서 :c:func:`PyLong_FromNativeBytes()` 및 :c:func:`PyLong_AsNativeBytes()`\\ 의 구현(둘을 함께 사용하면 필요한 API의 제한된 버전을 제공함)에는 약 500 LOC가 소요되었지만(현재 구현에서는 약 100 LOC), 비교하면 상당히 많습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:52:12.960151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Drop :c:member:`~PyLongExport.value` field from the export API",
      "source_hash": 5988472635325899903,
      "context_hash": 6883385743561290628,
      "translation": "내보내기 API에서 :c:member:`~PyLongExport.value` 필드를 제거합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:47.257025Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "With this suggestion, only one export type will exist (array of \"digits\").",
      "source_hash": 6920577938076491600,
      "context_hash": 15912734171507099288,
      "translation": "이 제안에 따르면 내보내기 유형은 하나만 존재합니다(\"digits\" 배열).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:47.257029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "If such view is not available for a given integer, it will be either emulated by export functions or the :c:func:`PyLong_Export` will return an error.",
      "source_hash": 9508125650487943726,
      "context_hash": 6901270175108261145,
      "translation": "주어진 정수에 이러한 뷰를 사용할 수 없는 경우, 내보내기 함수로 에뮬레이션하거나 :c:func:`PyLong_Export`\\ 은 오류를 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:47.257029Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "In both cases, it's assumed that users will use other C-API functions to get \"small enough\" integers (i.e., that fits to some machine integer types), like the :c:func:`PyLong_AsLongAndOverflow`.",
      "source_hash": 3741228251476251826,
      "context_hash": 9895163662137416386,
      "translation": "두 경우 모두 사용자가 일부 머신 정수 유형에 들어갈 만큼 \"충분히 작은\" 정수를 얻기 위해 :c:func:`PyLong_AsLongAndOverflow`\\ 처럼 다른 C API 함수를 사용할 것으로 가정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:47.257030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "The :c:func:`PyLong_Export` will be inefficient (or just fail) in this case.",
      "source_hash": 867544507843970375,
      "context_hash": 5191859009046795561,
      "translation": "이 경우 :c:func:`PyLong_Export`\\ 은 비효율적이거나 단순히 실패합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:47.257030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "An example",
      "source_hash": 14613974505844111414,
      "context_hash": 16790208855785814876,
      "translation": "예시",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:47.257030Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "This might look as a simplification from the API designer point of view, but will be less convenient for end users.",
      "source_hash": 3862068590245672926,
      "context_hash": 3997045173656633322,
      "translation": "API 설계자의 관점에서는 이것이 단순화처럼 보일 수 있지만, 최종 사용자에게는 덜 편리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:47.257031Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:17/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "They will have to follow Python development, benchmark different variants for exporting small integers (is that obvious why above case was chosen instead of :c:func:`PyLong_AsInt64`?), maybe support different code paths for various CPython versions or across different Python implementations.",
      "source_hash": 1597611475345893321,
      "context_hash": 6547091519378641572,
      "translation": "사용자는 Python 개발을 따라가고, 작은 정수를 내보내는 여러 변형을 벤치마크하며(위의 경우가 :c:func:`PyLong_AsInt64`\\ 대신 선택된 이유가 분명합니까?), 다양한 CPython 버전에서 또는 서로 다른 Python 구현 간에 서로 다른 코드 경로를 지원해야 할 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:47.257031Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Discussions",
      "source_hash": 10987630735954210954,
      "context_hash": 11046121647387883617,
      "translation": "논의",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:47.257032Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Discourse: `PEP 757 – C API to import-export Python integers <https://discuss.python.org/t/63895>`_",
      "source_hash": 15356241696674779516,
      "context_hash": 3155314491596926815,
      "translation": "Discourse: `PEP 757 – Python 정수 가져오기 및 내보내기를 위한 C API <https://discuss.python.org/t/63895>`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:16:47.257032Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:18/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`C API Working Group decision issue #35 <https://github.com/capi-workgroup/decisions/issues/35>`_",
      "source_hash": 33391914365010351,
      "context_hash": 15610893772723197507,
      "translation": "`C API 작업 그룹 결정 이슈 #35 <https://github.com/capi-workgroup/decisions/issues/35>`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
